title: workspace:set-default
tags: [[GUI command]] Workspaces
kind: reference
summary: Make a saved workspace the repository's default

`workspace:set-default <name>` makes a saved workspace — a layout or a work — the
repository's default: a workspace that takes the repository opens on it. Only the name
is written, so overwriting that save changes what the default opens on. See
[[Saved workspaces]].
